(102, 3, 9, 1, '\r\nKanu Paul <hr@1solutions.biz>\r\nFri, Jun 24, 2022, 5:45 PM\r\nto sk591978\r\n\r\nHi Shivam,\r\n\r\nHope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nThis is with reference to the Web Developer we have at 1Solutions. We are happy to welcome you to the 1Solutions family and hope you will maintain the high work standards, you set earlier.\r\n\r\nWe have intent to offer you the following:\r\n\r\nSalary - INR 20,000 Monthly\r\n\r\nDesignation:   Web Developer \r\nDate of Joining: 27th June 2022\r\n\r\nWe would require the following documents at the time of joining -\r\n\r\n 1. Your previous company joining letter/relieving letter\r\n 2. Address & ID proof (Voter ID/Passport/Ration card/Driving license)\r\n 3. Scanned copy of your passport size photograph\r\n \r\nPlease revert with your acceptance at the earliest by sending a reply to this email.\r\n\r\n', '2025-03-26 11:39:06', '2025-03-26 17:11:43'),
