(117, 9, 9, 1, 'Hi Nitin,\r\n\r\nHope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nThis is with the reference to the  Full Stack Developer position we have at 1Solutions. We are happy to welcome you with 1Solutions family and hope you will maintain the high work standards you have set earlier.\r\n\r\nWe have intent to offer you the following:\r\n\r\nOverall Annual CTC - INR Two  Lakh Seventy Six Thousand per annum [INR 23000 monthly]\r\n\r\nDesignation     :  Full Stack Developer\r\nDate Of Joining: 1st.Jan.2024\r\n\r\nWe would require the following documents at the time of joining -\r\n\r\n 1. Your previous company joining letter/relieving letter\r\n 2. Address & ID proof (Voter ID/Passport/Ration card/Driving license)\r\n 3.4 Passport size photograph\r\n 4. Aadhar Card , Pan Card photocopy for Bank Account.\r\n 5.Educational Certificates 10 & 12 marksheet photocopy, Graduation certificate. \r\n\r\nPlease revert with your acceptance at the earliest by sending a reply to this email.\r\n', '2025-03-26 11:39:26', '2025-03-26 18:14:16'),
