(237, 1, '2025-09-24 00:00:00', '2025-09-24 00:00:00', 1, 'Good Afternoon Sir/Ma’am,\r\n\r\nDue to an academic commitment, I need to visit Delhi University North Campus and will be unable to attend the office tomorrow.\r\n\r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nAditya', 2, 42, 0, 2, '2025-09-23 10:13:21'),
(238, 1, '2025-09-26 00:00:00', '2025-09-26 00:00:00', 1, 'Hi ma\'am,\r\nI would like to request leave on 26th September 2025 as I have to attend my brother’s engagement ceremony. Kindly grant me leave for one day.\r\nThank you for your consideration.\r\nWarm Regards,\r\nNikita', 2, 29, 0, 2, '2025-09-25 04:36:48'),
(239, 3, '2025-09-26 00:00:00', '2025-09-26 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning sir/ma\'am\r\nI\'m writing to inform you that I\'m not feeling well and I\'m experiencing stomach ache discomfort. I won\'t be able to come into the office today. \r\n\r\nThankyou for your understanding\r\nBest Regards\r\nAsha\r\n', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-09-26 01:57:40'),
(241, 1, '2025-10-03 00:00:00', '2025-10-03 00:00:00', 1, 'I would like to request a half-day (Second Half) leave to attend my cousin’s roka ceremony.\r\n\r\n', 1, 36, 0, 2, '2025-10-01 13:40:50'),
(242, 1, '2025-10-09 00:00:00', '2025-10-09 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning ma\'am/sir\r\nI am suffering from fever. I won\'t be able to attend the office today. \r\nThank you for your understanding. ', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-10-09 03:16:43'),
(243, 1, '2025-10-13 00:00:00', '2025-10-13 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\nI request a half-day leave  for personal reasons. I will ensure my work is completed before leaving.\r\nThank you.\r\n', 1, 50, 0, 2, '2025-10-13 02:47:10'),
(244, 1, '2025-10-13 00:00:00', '2025-10-13 00:00:00', 1, 'Hello Sir, I have to leave a little early today as it is my cousin sister\'s function today, so I want you to give me permission to leave by 4 pm or 5 pm.', 1, 53, 0, 2, '2025-10-13 05:39:13'),
(245, 1, '2025-10-16 00:00:00', '2025-10-16 00:00:00', 1, 'Good Afternoon Sir and Ma’am,\r\n\r\nDue to a family gathering, I will not be able to attend the office on October 16, 2025.\r\n\r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nAditya', 2, 42, 0, 2, '2025-10-15 08:38:18'),
(246, 3, '2025-10-16 00:00:00', '2025-10-16 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir/mam,\r\nI Request a leave for tomorrow as i  have a college commitment and won\'t be able to attend office. \r\nThank you.\r\n', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-10-15 09:24:08'),
(247, 3, '2025-10-24 00:00:00', '2025-10-24 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear sir/ma\'am\r\n\r\nI am writing to request leave on 24th October 2025 due to some personal work. I kindly request you to grant me leave for the mentioned date.\r\n\r\n', 2, 36, 0, 2, '2025-10-20 15:27:25'),
(249, 3, '2025-10-21 00:00:00', '2025-10-21 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning sir/ma\'am\r\nI am suffering from fever I won\'t be able to attend the office today. \r\nBest Regards \r\nAsha', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-10-21 03:18:01'),
(251, 3, '2025-10-24 00:00:00', '2025-10-24 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir/mam, \r\nI Request a leave\r\nfor 24 October as i\r\nhave a college commitment and\r\nwon\'t be able to attend\r\noffice. \r\nThank you.', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-10-22 03:42:32'),
(257, 1, '2025-10-24 00:00:00', '2025-10-24 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear mam\r\nToday I am not come to office due to some personal work. So kindly grant me leave for one day. \r\nShikha Pandey ', 2, 46, 0, 2, '2025-10-24 03:27:14'),
(260, 1, '2025-10-27 00:00:00', '2025-10-27 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI would like to request leave on 27/10/2025 to celebrate Chhath Puja with my family. I kindly request you to grant me leave for this day.\r\n\r\nThank you for your consideration.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nDeepak Kumar', 2, 17, 0, 2, '2025-10-24 09:27:13'),
(261, 3, '2025-10-27 00:00:00', '2025-10-28 00:00:00', 2, 'Good Evening Sir/Ma\'am\r\nI want leave for two days for chhath Puja Celebrations. Due to this reason i am unable to come to the office .\r\nPlease grant me two days leave.\r\nThanks for your understanding\r\nAsha ', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-10-24 12:22:07'),
(262, 1, '2025-10-27 00:00:00', '2025-10-27 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear  Sir/Ma\'am\r\nI would like to request leave for one day on 27-10-2025  to celebrate Chhath Puja with my family. Kindly grant me leave for the day.\r\n\r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nSonu Yadav ', 2, 55, 0, 2, '2025-10-26 08:20:32'),
(263, 3, '2025-10-28 00:00:00', '2025-10-28 00:00:00', 1, 'Respected Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI would like to inform you that I need one day’s leave due to some personal work. Kindly grant me leave for 28/10/2025.\r\n\r\nI shall be grateful to you for your kind consideration. I will make sure to complete all my pending tasks upon returning.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\nDeepak', 2, 17, 0, 2, '2025-10-28 02:26:41'),
(264, 1, '2025-10-29 00:00:00', '2025-10-29 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Ma\'am, \r\nI hope this message finds you well. I would like to request leave for Wednesday, 29th October 2025, as I need to visit the bank to attend to some personal Work.\r\nI kindly request you to grant me leave for the day. \r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\nBest,\r\nNikita', 2, 29, 0, 2, '2025-10-28 08:34:28'),
(265, 1, '2025-11-05 00:00:00', '2025-11-05 00:00:00', 1, 'I would like to inform you that I will be on leave on 05-11-2025 in observance of Guru Nanak Jayanti', 2, 36, 0, 2, '2025-11-03 04:13:16'),
(266, 1, '2025-11-04 00:00:00', '2025-11-04 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear mam\r\nToday I am not come to office due to high fever. \r\nSo please kindly grant me leave for one day.\r\nBest Regards, \r\nShikha Pandey ', 2, 46, 0, 2, '2025-11-04 02:51:43'),
(267, 1, '2025-11-05 00:00:00', '2025-11-05 00:00:00', 1, 'dear Sir/mam,\r\nI request a leave for tomorrow as i have a family function that i need to attend . I won\'t be able to attend office .\r\nThankyou', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-11-04 07:39:50'),
(268, 1, '2025-11-10 00:00:00', '2025-11-10 00:00:00', 1, 'Respected sir and ma\'am,\r\nDue to pending result issue in my graduation I need to visit my campus, for this following reason I\'m unable to attend office on 10th Nov,\r\n\r\nThanks for your understanding \r\nAditya ', 2, 42, 0, 2, '2025-11-09 18:38:11'),
(269, 1, '2025-11-10 00:00:00', '2025-11-10 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning ma\'am/sir \r\nI am suffering from fever. I won\'t be\r\nable to attend the office\r\ntoday. \r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\nAsha ', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-11-10 03:22:09'),
(270, 3, '2025-11-10 00:00:00', '2025-11-10 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear mam, \r\nToday I am not come to office due to high fever. \r\nSo please kindly grant me leave for one day. \r\nBest regards, \r\nShikha Pandey ', 2, 46, 0, 2, '2025-11-10 04:29:50'),
(271, 3, '2025-11-14 00:00:00', '2025-11-14 00:00:00', 1, 'dear Sir / mam ,\r\nI hope you are doing well. I would like to request a half-day leave tomorrow as I have to give a presentation at my college. I plan to take the leave after lunch\r\nThankyou', 1, 50, 0, 2, '2025-11-13 09:53:42'),
(272, 3, '2025-11-18 00:00:00', '2025-11-18 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning sir/ma\'am\r\nI want a leave for one day, as I have to visit University of Delhi to collect my books. \r\nBest Regards \r\nAsha ', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-11-18 01:31:00'),
(273, 3, '2025-11-18 00:00:00', '2025-11-18 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Mam, \r\nI have to get my college books today, so I will not come to office today.\r\nBest regards, \r\nShikha Pandey ', 2, 46, 0, 2, '2025-11-18 02:54:37'),
(274, 3, '2025-11-26 00:00:00', '2025-11-26 00:00:00', 1, 'I would like to inform you that I will need to take leave on 26th\r\nNovember to attend a court hearing. Kindly approve my leave\r\nfor this day.', 2, 36, 0, 2, '2025-11-19 04:27:36'),
(275, 3, '2025-11-21 00:00:00', '2025-11-21 00:00:00', 1, 'dear Sir / mam , \r\nI would like to request a leave for 21st November, as I need to visit my college for an important project submission. This submission is mandatory, and my presence at the college is required.\r\nThankyou', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-11-19 06:08:30'),
(276, 1, '2025-11-20 00:00:00', '2025-11-20 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Ma\'am,\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\nI would like to request leave for [20-11-2025], as I need to travel to Chandigarh to attend a family function.\r\nTherefore, I kindly request you to grant me leave for the day.\r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\nWarm regards,\r\nNikita\r\n', 2, 29, 0, 2, '2025-11-19 08:39:21'),
(277, 1, '2025-11-24 00:00:00', '2025-11-25 00:00:00', 2, 'Dear Sir,\r\n \r\nI hope you are doing well. I would like to request leave for two days, from 24/11/2025 to 25/11/2025, to attend my brother’s wedding. It is a significant family event, and I need to be there to support and celebrate with my family.\r\n\r\nI assure you that I will complete any pending work before my leave and ensure a smooth handover if required.\r\n \r\nThank you for your understanding and support. I look forward to your approval.\r\n \r\nBest regards,\r\nChetan Pal\r\n1Solutions', 2, 52, 0, 2, '2025-11-20 11:28:17'),
(278, 3, '2025-11-24 00:00:00', '2025-11-24 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning sir/ma\'am\r\nDue to a medical appointment, I will be visiting the hospital today and will be available at the office for a half-day.\r\nBest Regards\r\nAsha', 1, 57, 0, 2, '2025-11-24 02:34:14'),
(279, 3, '2025-11-27 00:00:00', '2025-11-27 00:00:00', 1, 'dear Sir / mam ,\r\nI would like to request\r\na leave for 27th November,\r\nas I need to visit\r\nmy college for an important\r\nproject submission. This submission is\r\nmandatory, and my presence at\r\nthe college is required. \r\nThankyou', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-11-25 09:20:46'),
(280, 3, '2025-11-26 00:00:00', '2025-11-26 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning ma\'am/sir I am\r\nsuffering from fever. I won\'t\r\nbe able to attend the office today.\r\nThank you for your understanding. Asha', 2, 57, 0, 2, '2025-11-26 03:37:50'),
(281, 1, '2025-11-27 00:00:00', '2025-11-27 00:00:00', 1, 'Today I am not feeling well. I have developed fever and cold. Therefore I will not be able to come to the office today.', 2, 53, 0, 2, '2025-11-26 18:48:59'),
(282, 1, '2025-11-28 00:00:00', '2025-11-28 00:00:00', 1, 'Hi Sir/Ma\'am, I have some important work tomorrow . So I\'ll not be able to come to the office. Plz Grant me leave. \r\nRegards, Sonu', 2, 55, 0, 2, '2025-11-27 13:02:05'),
(283, 1, '2025-12-02 00:00:00', '2025-12-02 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir/Mam, I am not feeling\r\nwell due to stomach pain\r\nand request a first half day . I will come in office after lunch. \r\nThank you.', 1, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-02 01:06:23'),
(284, 1, '2025-12-02 00:00:00', '2025-12-02 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning, sir and ma\'am I have to go to the bank today, I have some important work, I will come by half day today.', 1, 53, 0, 2, '2025-12-02 02:13:06'),
(285, 1, '2025-12-03 00:00:00', '2025-12-03 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Mam, \r\nToday I am not come to office due to high Head pain. \r\nSo kindly grant me leave for one day. \r\nBest Regards, \r\nShikha Pandey ', 2, 46, 0, 2, '2025-12-03 03:19:16'),
(286, 3, '2025-12-04 00:00:00', '2025-12-04 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir / Mam ,\r\nI would like to request\r\na leave for 4th December,\r\nas I need to visit\r\nmy college for an important\r\nproject submission. This submission is\r\nmandatory, and my presence at\r\nthe college is required.\r\nThankyou', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-03 09:05:44'),
(287, 1, '2025-12-04 00:00:00', '2025-12-04 00:00:00', 1, 'Good morning sir/ma\'am\r\nI need to take half-day leave to visit the bank. I will complete my tasks and ensure my work is covered. Please approve my request.\r\nBest Regards \r\nAsha \r\n', 1, 57, 0, 2, '2025-12-04 03:09:08'),
(288, 1, '2025-12-08 00:00:00', '2025-12-08 00:00:00', 1, 'Hi Sir,\r\n\r\nI am writing to request a leave of absence for Monday, 8th December  2025, due to some urgent personal work at home that requires my immediate attention.\r\n\r\nThanks for your understanding.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nRitika', 2, 1, 0, 2, '2025-12-07 19:03:39'),
(289, 3, '2025-12-08 00:00:00', '2025-12-08 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir / Mam \r\nI would like to request for you give me the first half day. I have to go to college for to get my admit card. \r\nI will come in office after lunch. \r\nThank you .', 1, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-08 01:53:54'),
(290, 3, '2025-12-12 00:00:00', '2025-12-12 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir / Mam,\r\nI would like to inform you that I have an exam on the 12th December, therefore I will not able to attend the office on that day. kindly grant me one day leave. \r\nThank you. ', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-09 10:39:45'),
(291, 3, '2025-12-11 00:00:00', '2025-12-11 00:00:00', 1, 'I have to take my mother to the hospital and there is some work going on at home so I have to get some stuff, due to which I will not be able to come today.', 2, 53, 0, 2, '2025-12-11 02:09:33'),
(292, 1, '2025-12-12 00:00:00', '2025-12-12 00:00:00', 1, 'Good afternoon Ma’am and Sir,\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nI would like to inform you that due to my upcoming university examinations, I will be unable to attend the office on the mentioned dates. Please refer to the attached admit card in mail for your reference.', 2, 42, 0, 2, '2025-12-11 08:48:26'),
(293, 3, '2025-12-17 00:00:00', '2025-12-17 00:00:00', 1, 'Good afternoon Ma’am and Sir,\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nI would like to inform you that due to my upcoming university examinations, I will be unable to attend the office on the mentioned dates. Please refer to the attached admit card in mail for your reference.', 2, 42, 0, 2, '2025-12-11 08:49:23'),
(294, 1, '2025-12-12 00:00:00', '2025-12-12 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Ma’am,\r\nI am writing to inform you that I am not feeling well, therefore I will not be able to come to the office today. I request you to kindly grant me leave for the day.\r\nThank you for your understanding.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nNikita', 2, 29, 0, 2, '2025-12-11 23:55:26'),
(295, 1, '2025-12-17 00:00:00', '2025-12-17 00:00:00', 1, 'I would like to formally request leave on 17 December due to a personal matter that requires my attention.', 2, 36, 0, 2, '2025-12-15 03:55:27'),
(296, 1, '2025-12-15 00:00:00', '2025-12-15 00:00:00', 1, 'Hi Sir, a family member is unwell, so I will not be able to come to office today.\r\nThank you!', 2, 15, 0, 2, '2025-12-15 05:35:39'),
(297, 3, '2025-12-17 00:00:00', '2025-12-17 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir / Mam,\r\nI would like to inform you that I have an exam on the 17th December, therefore I will not able to attend the office on that day. kindly grant me one day leave. \r\nThank you.', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-15 12:02:50'),
(298, 3, '2025-12-19 00:00:00', '2025-12-19 00:00:00', 1, 'Dear Sir / Mam, \r\nI would like to inform you that I have an exam on the 19th December, therefore I will not able to attend the office on that day. kindly grant me one day leave.\r\nThank you.', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-15 12:04:16'),
(299, 3, '2025-12-18 00:00:00', '2025-12-18 00:00:00', 1, 'Respected Sir/Madam,\r\nI would like to inform you that I have to attend college today. Therefore, I will be taking a half-day leave and will report to the office after lunch.\r\nThankyou ', 2, 50, 0, 2, '2025-12-18 01:50:53'),
(300, 3, '2025-12-23 00:00:00', '2025-12-23 00:00:00', 1, 'Good afternoon Ma’am and Sir, I\r\nhope you are doing well. I\r\nwould like to inform you\r\nthat due to my upcoming\r\nuniversity examinations, I will be\r\nunable to attend the office\r\non the mentioned dates. Please\r\nrefer to the attached admit\r\ncard in mail for your\r\nreference.', 2, 42, 0, 0, '2025-12-18 04:24:18');
